# Base URL of the deployed API, called directly from the browser (bypassing Firebase Hosting,
# whose rewrite proxy times out after 60 s). The URL is deterministic for a 2nd-gen function:
# https://<region>-<project id>.cloudfunctions.net/<functionId>. Keep in step with .firebaserc
# and functions/index.js (region). Not a secret.
VITE_API_BASE=https://europe-west1-ce-earth-viewer.cloudfunctions.net/api
